{"id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping.md","title":"Pumping Lemma for Regular Languages","display":"thm-regular-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Regular Languages","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping","aliases":["73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping","73-thm-regular-pumping-lemma"],"display":"thm-regular-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Regular Languages","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","[[73-df-language-pumping-length]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping</span><span>73-thm-regular-pumping-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-pumping-lemma — Pumping Lemma for Regular Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"01b7b9d9615ddaa5\" href=\"?note=01b7b9d9615ddaa5\" title=\"73-df-language-pumping-length\">73-df-language-pumping-length</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (regular language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\">\\(p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\)</span> (canonical pumping length, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01b7b9d9615ddaa5\" href=\"?note=01b7b9d9615ddaa5\" title=\"73-df-language-pumping-length\">73-df-language-pumping-length</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\to\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=xyz\\land |xy|\\leq p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\land |y|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(xy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\to\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=xyz\\land |xy|\\leq p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\land |y|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(xy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Among the first <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)+1\">\\(p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)+1\\)</span> states of the accepting run, two coincide. The intervening nonempty segment is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>, and repeating or deleting its loop preserves the final state.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-pumping-length","status":"resolved","id":"01b7b9d9615ddaa5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-pumping-length]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular language, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-pumping-length","status":"resolved","id":"01b7b9d9615ddaa5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)$ (canonical pumping length, see [[73-df-language-pumping-length]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in L\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|w|\\geq p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\to\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\nw=xyz\\land |xy|\\leq p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\land |y|\\geq1\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(xy^iz\\in L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)+1","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false}],"bytes":1169,"backlinks":[{"id":"1dd8b3118783dcb5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["c284ffb568a496fd","01b7b9d9615ddaa5"]}